stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle
    Idle --> Connecting : connect
    Connecting --> Connected : ack
    Connecting --> Error : timeout
    Connected --> Transferring : send
    Transferring --> Connected : done
    Transferring --> Error : checksum failed
    Connected --> Idle : disconnect
    Error --> Idle : reset

    note right of Transferring : v2 adds data transfer

    classDef errorState fill:#fdd,stroke:#c00,color:#900
    class Error errorState
